x86_64-windows  a rethrow - `throw;` - is refused for this target: it is _CxxThrowException with two null pointers, raised from inside a handler funclet rather than from the frame that owns the try, which has not been measured on the box (rethrow.notarget). The class-typed throw this case also needs landed for this target on 2026-09-26. The question itself is Itanium's alone: there is no `__cxa_end_catch` on that ABI, a handler being a funclet the runtime ends the catch for when it returns.
